{c: Verse 1}
[F]Seedhe saadhe sara sauda,        [F]seedha seedha hona jee
[Gm]Main ne to ko pana hai ya,        [Gm]tu ne main ko khona jee
[Dm]Aaja dilki kar saude [C]bazi kya narazi,        Aa re [A#]aaa re are [F]aaa
Sauda hai [F]dil ka ye Tu [Dm]kar bhi le,        [C]Mera jahan bahon me tu [F]bhar bhi le
Saude mein [F]de kasam [Dm]Kasam bhi le,        [C]Aake tu nighahon me [F]sawar bhi le
Sauda [Dm]udano ka hai Ya [C]Asmano ka hai,        Le le [A#]udane meri Le mere [F]Par bhi le
Sauda [Dm]umeedon ka hai,        Khawaabon ka [C]neendon ka hai
Le Le tu [A#]neendein meri,        Naino mein [F]ghar bhi le
